      ":question/problem": "![](images/f8/f8f93ab00ff79e039a8de292dcfd8ccb712ca1857494f3bc261616c9a37a7608.png)\n\nA teacher recorded the results of math tests taken by two separate groups of students. This information is displayed using the dot plots shown above.\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe interquartile range (IQR) of the scores for the first group is\n{{field-1}}.\n\nThe interquartile range (IQR) of the scores for the second group is\n{{field-2}}.\n\nComparing the IQRs suggests that the data for the\n{{field-3}} group is more spread out."
